d\" in July, \"open\" at Allentown in May, and \"submitted\" from Newark in September. It may be one ticket reopened or several numbers that got merged. Someone should check the ticket system.\n- **PD-8841 (April) and #8841 (May/Sept)** may be the same ticket. The digests don't confirm this.\n- Excluded as Mobility: #4812 (2025-03 digest) and the Vantorre Mobility items in the 2025-12-01 and 2026-09-30 digests.\n- The 2026-08-03 digest and the 2026-05-03 prep note mention Vantorre incidents but give no ticket numbers, so they add nothing here.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000127","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
